0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/9C4uTEEOJlM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> You're one of us. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 07-28-2014, 09:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T18:39:12-07:00","id":211898,"title":"","content":"*giggles* that made me smile yay! I also now kinda want to draw a head goblin...i have this weird image in my head of what i think one may look it like...wish my tablet wasnt on the other side of the room and that i wasnt on the verge of falling asleep. i'm gonna end up dreaming about head goblins tonight i think lol My dreams have been crazy vivid, and crazy in general usually based around shit i saw before falling asleep. *fingers crossed that i dont get nightmares*<br /> <br /> <br /> I need to get my butt more active in this community...I so rarely post, I read a ton of threads though and come up with responses then..just dont post them,kinda shy.(what the hell shyness why must you extend to the damn internet to!?) i also have a problem with if a thread gets to many replies i sorta just stop replying..not on purpose i just feel like if i read through replies and only quote one person that people will think i'm ignore everyone else....grr... i need to work on that seriously! <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-29T06:58:29-07:00","id":212421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scelesta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=211898#post211898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*giggles* that made me smile yay! I also now kinda want to draw a head goblin...i have this weird image in my head of what i think one may look it like...wish my tablet wasnt on the other side of the room and that i wasnt on the verge of falling asleep. i'm gonna end up dreaming about head goblins tonight i think lol My dreams have been crazy vivid, and crazy in general usually based around shit i saw before falling asleep. *fingers crossed that i dont get nightmares*<br /> <br /> <br /> I need to get my butt more active in this community...I so rarely post, I read a ton of threads though and come up with responses then..just dont post them,kinda shy.(what the hell shyness why must you extend to the damn internet to!?) i also have a problem with if a thread gets to many replies i sorta just stop replying..not on purpose i just feel like if i read through replies and only quote one person that people will think i'm ignore everyone else....grr... i need to work on that seriously!<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>You! Post more now! We demand it!<br /> <br /> Does that help any? My &quot;head gremlins&quot; are known to be an aggressive little bunch of bastards.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-29T13:39:57-07:00","id":212733,"title":"","content":"hehe i Plan to post more when i can actually focus, my heads all foggy right now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm feeling much better this morning, got a decent nights sleep(slept from midnight to noon) took a long hot shower, a couple vicodin and now i feel GREAT. a fair bit sleepy but i was thinking todays gonna be a &quot;Sleep as much as i want day cause ive got nothing better to do&quot;<br /> <br /> This stupid being unable to walk without it hurting or sit at my desk thing has NOT in any way been good for my mental health, i hadnt realized how much walking around was helping me, or yano being able to use my fancy gaming pc instead of this shitty 8 year old laptop anything but laying on this couch all day in the dark cause i dont feel like turning anylights on or opening any blinds.<br /> <br /> I am so incredibly bored its not even funny...prolly gonna take another nap after I post this...I really need to respond to PM's but i'm being lazy i'll get to it later but i have seen them <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T12:14:10-07:00","id":216076,"title":"","content":"I'm talking to myself a LOT these days. It's getting creepy. I'm scaring myself.<br /> I feel like a very exhausted Gollum/Smeagol. I'm threatening myself, telling myself that people are lying to me, saying random and disturbingly violent phrases without any semblance of context. I'm hiding it, because if I'm creeping myself out, then I'll likely look completely batshit to others. I haven't slept yet, either, and that's making my mind a very confusing place. <br /> <br /> If my head doesn't clear up soon, I might have to be admitted to the psychiatric unit for some period of time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T13:34:04-07:00","id":216119,"title":"","content":"Sleep would probably take care of a multitude of problems including the paranoia and talking to yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T13:39:43-07:00","id":216123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=216119#post216119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sleep would probably take care of a multitude of problems including the paranoia and talking to yourself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Might well do yea. There's one point I remember rather well in college... I had just pulled an all-nighter in the lab after a whole series of very very late nights. I got onto the subway/light rail, grabbed a rail to hold onto (no seats left) and we left the station. Then I became convinced that everyone on the train with a nose was an assassin that would kill me if I moved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T13:48:19-07:00","id":216131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=216123#post216123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Might well do yea. There's one point I remember rather well in college... I had just pulled an all-nighter in the lab after a whole series of very very late nights. I got onto the subway/light rail, grabbed a rail to hold onto (no seats left) and we left the station. Then I became convinced that everyone on the train with a nose was an assassin that would kill me if I moved.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've had stuff like that!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T15:49:15-07:00","id":216222,"title":"","content":"Maybe i'm just wanting an escape, I dont want to feel anything and when i'm high i dont, nothing matters nothing hurts, everything is just...calm. It doesnt take me much to get addicted to how something feels... I&quot;m out of vicodin, and i'm not happy about it dont thinki can i get my doc to give me more either....a week on the shit and i'm not wanting to go back to NOT being on it...trying to get ahold of weed, cause it has the same mood altering effect...i Just dont want to be sober i guess.<br /> <br /> i'm sober now and i hate it.I'm moody and brooding and upset, and lonely.....theres vodka in the kitchen but i dont drink, it doesnt help just makes me depressed as all hell which is kinda not what i'm looking for...<br /> <br /> My thoughts are all over the place, vicodin and pot do something to my brain, slows it down, makes me &quot;normal&quot; my mood swings vanish, the racing thoughts slow..i feel like myself again. NO prescription mental health drug has ever managed to do this for me...<br /> <br /> i think i'm going to try to sleep again before my mood tanks.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T11:56:33-07:00","id":219338,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=216123#post216123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Might well do yea. There's one point I remember rather well in college... I had just pulled an all-nighter in the lab after a whole series of very very late nights. I got onto the subway/light rail, grabbed a rail to hold onto (no seats left) and we left the station. Then I became convinced that everyone on the train with a nose was an assassin that would kill me if I moved.</div> </div> </div> </div>Once I sat in a restaurant surrounded by mirrors. With my back to a door. Nearly shit myself in front of everyone there.<br /> <br /> Nothing good ever happens on Atlantic Boulevard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>A Green Sun Destrier</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/77-kongurous","name":"kongurous","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar77_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"417"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T16:46:07-07:00","id":219615,"title":"","content":"deleted by the guy","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":372,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","user":"cerealkiller","date":". 01-23-2018, 02:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T16:48:50-07:00","id":219617,"title":"","content":"I'm cheering for you, killer. It sucks that things have gotten this bad for you, but I'm very glad you're seeing someone who can help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T17:44:11-07:00","id":219676,"title":"","content":"deleted by the guy","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":372,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","user":"cerealkiller","date":". 01-23-2018, 02:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T18:19:15-07:00","id":219708,"title":"","content":"I have been trying to write about this for a while now, but every time, it comes out crap. Whatever gift I ever had for telling stories, it seems to be gone, or at least run down to rust and ruin. Ugh. Fuck it, this is my last shot at it, and I'm hitting that Post Reply button no matter how bad this comes out.<br /> <br /> I have come to a point in my personal development where I have accepted that my identity is part of the problem which needs solving. I cannot keep telling myself how bad I am, because when the statement is phrased that way--&quot;I am bad&quot;--badness becomes my identity, and everything flowing from that is poisoned. For one thing, it minimizes and denies any part of me that is not bad. For another, it mistakes a behavior or a moment in time for a sum total of a person. For a third and most dangerous thing, it writes me off as someone inherently bad who cannot be saved and who is therefore exempt from having to try hard because it would be impossible for a bad person not to be bad.<br /> <br /> I am therefore watching my self-talk, and doing my best to avoid saying things like &quot;I am bad&quot; in favor of more accurate statements like &quot;I have done a bad thing&quot; or &quot;I feel bad at this time.&quot; I don't know if it's helping, but I'm working on it even though it's hard. It's <i>exhausting</i>. Being on your guard constantly against your own mind means paying attention to every single thought you have and meticulously examining it through a perspective that is not your own and does not come easily to you so you have to construct it from scratch almost every time. I fail at it a lot, and I expect to fail at it a lot more before I get it right. I am doing my best to forgive myself for those failures, though, because they are a necessary part of the learning process and because I need to convince myself that failing is not the same thing as being a failure unless I choose for it to be.<br /> <br /> It is time for me to step up the game, though, and I mention that at this point because the talk of failure is my next big hurdle, and maybe one of the most fundamental hurdles to my personality and self-image. I live in mortal terror of failure, because I cannot forgive myself for them. I beat myself up endlessly for every failure small and large; for instance, I still want to respond to the year-old failure of having reached across a dinner table for a pot of mayo rather than asking the person I reached over by inflicting physical pain upon myself. Bad table manners equals a desire to grab an X-Acto knife and start a-cutting, which is pretty fucked up when you think about it (it is also pretty fucked up that I need to think about it to notice that's pretty fucked up, but never mind, we're getting really meta now).<br /> <br /> Whatever. I bring that up because my response to this fear of failure is to not set goals for myself. I cannot fail if I have no defined criteria for success. This cowardly approach has immunized me from the worst of my self-hatred, and it has also done serious damage to my physical health (why not have another box of pizza? It's not like I have a goal of losing weight) as well as my mental health, and now I am struggling with learning how to have objective goals. This is hard for me not just because of my fear of failure but because I am just not an objective thinker, instead couching all my thoughts in comparison and subjective impressions. I can't measure height or weight because I don't know the numbers and can only judge things by comparison (taller than me; heavier than my sister). Same with distance, temperature, or pretty much anything a person can measure by attaching a number to it. I need to learn these things because if I want to learn the value of success, then I have to set objective and measurable goals for myself so I can actually tell if I achieve them without having to rely on a panel of judges in my head whose criteria is unknown and at least one of whom is in the pocket of a special interest that wants me to commit suicide.<br /> <br /> I am, in short, having to not only rewire the way I think, but also learn simple models most people learned as children, and that second thing I worry is beyond me. I actually like the fuzzy edges of my vision; they lend my voice an emotional component that I think really defines me in a mostly good way. I am afraid that objectivity will diminish me.<br /> <br /> I hope I can find a balance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T18:41:54-07:00","id":219719,"title":"","content":"deleted by the guy","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":372,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","user":"cerealkiller","date":". 01-23-2018, 02:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T06:24:53-07:00","id":220098,"title":"","content":"I'm alive. Hope you feel better and get the vertigo problem remedied, CK. <br /> Jim, I don't really know what to say, because I verbally abuse myself to the point that I genuinely daydream about the relief that a bullet blasting through my skull or falling on one of my own bowie knives would be. I'm glad you're trying something, and for me, I'd gladly sacrifice some objectivity for some love of self or some peace. Thanks for the encouragement, PB. And that was SUCH a sweet message, Scel. <br /> <br /> I'm ... not good.<br /> <br /> I'm going to go now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T07:09:10-07:00","id":220125,"title":"","content":"Huh...for some reason, I thought your posts were Monday, 'killer, and I was looking forward to hearing how your doctor's appointment went. I guess it probably hasn't even happened yet, though. Oh well, keep us in the loop.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=220098#post220098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jim, I don't really know what to say.</div> </div> </div> </div>About what? About where you are in relationship to my personal stage of growth? By all means, compare yourself to me if that seems useful to you, but don't sweat it if no comment seems to be required.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=220098#post220098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm...not good.</div> </div> </div> </div>You'll weather it. You're tough like that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T07:20:35-07:00","id":220157,"title":"","content":"deleted by the guy","signat