ts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-01T17:06:40-07:00","id":299479,"title":"","content":"I am done with my therapist..saw her yesterday and I couldnt stand the way she acted...I brought up that i'm smoking nearly a pack a day and she gave me this look and attitude that I am a terrible person for smoking while pregnant. While shit I'm fucking sorry the my anxiety is so bad and your only suggestion to me is to &quot;try breathing&quot;<br /> <br /> She also seems to be on the bus with my primary care doctor about me going back on my medication because &quot;having a baby is going to be hard&quot;. Uh no fucking shit i am well aware of this fact but i'm not going back on that shit. Its sad that smoking is safer then my anti anxiety meds...but thats just how it is. I am planning to quit but i need help to do so. <br /> <br /> I'm all over the place emotionally and its getting hard to manage. My anxiety is at an all time high, I am leaving hte house more, but being around people even those I know puts me on edge I feel like they are judging me for smoking, judging me for getting pregnant while my life is barely in my own controll...(It wasnt planned not in the slightest...) My own family seems to think i'm to immature to have a child which isnt helping cause I really did want my family to be supportive...No one thinks I can do this... Even my fiance is being an asshole about it, guilting me everytime i buy a pack of smokes, getting mad at me for nto quitting, refusing to understand how hard it is and wont listen when I try to explain its NOT easy. <br /> <br /> I JUST WANT TO BE LEFT ALONE. I want to stop being judged and pressured. I want to stop feeling like people are out to ruin my life or that everyone hates me secretly and are just to afraid to say it to my face. <br /> <br /> /end of a likely hormone fueled rant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T01:50:29-08:00","id":305454,"title":"","content":"I'm kinda depressed and want to curl into a ball and cry...I'm not suicidal or thinking about self harm just sad and afraid and wishing i could talk but everytime i try to type up whats going through my head i delete it because i just feel like a terrible person for the way i'm thinking. So my brain is giving me a great big &quot;oh you are sad and need to talk? oh fuck you you cant put that in a public place cause people will see it and think you are bad&quot;<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T05:04:28-08:00","id":305542,"title":"","content":"I don't know that I'd trust the word of your brain, Scelesta. I don't think it's on your side.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T08:45:38-08:00","id":305776,"title":"","content":"I cannot believe I just saw a poster elsewhere, outside of this site, who claimed going to a therapist is not really dealing with issues. It was in the context of discussing my Changeling character, but what the hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T14:14:20-08:00","id":306129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=305542#post305542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know that I'd trust the word of your brain, Scelesta. I don't think it's on your side.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know my brain is a fucking asshole 99% of the time.<br /> <br /> LIke today:<br /> <br /> I friggen broke into tears a few minuets ago when I misplaced the TV remote and couldnt find it..then found it sitting RIGHT IN FRONT OF ME IN PLAIN SIGHT. ;&gt;&gt;<br /> (I swear i dont usually cry over a lost remote....I'm just a tad emotional lately)<br /> <br /> I'm a little all over the fucking place...Thinking maybe i should take my docs advice and go back on the lamictal as soon as its safe cause blegh.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T20:51:31-08:00","id":306373,"title":"","content":"okay either i'm having a mood swing or retail therapy is what I needed....I was really sad in the clothing store as i couldnt find anything in my size that i even kinda liked...then as i nearly gave up i wandered into the pajama section, a couple robes, some pjs and fluffy socks later I'm at home warm in my fuzzy super soft robe and warm jammies in an AMAZING mood...fuck regular clothes i can go places in a robe <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I have like 2 dresses if ineed to wear something nice lol I even got to order some henna for my hair offline so tommrow i get to spend the afternoon pampering myself.<br /> <br /> Also i bought a single outfit for the baby, the FIRST thing i;ve bought for the baby, its friggen adorable and makes me smile as it matches my robe i'm dork and think thats cute. I hate pink. I'm gonna murder the first person to give me pink anything if i have girl i have stated to family and friend I am planning on blue and white regardless on gender.<br /> <br /> I;m kinda creeped out by how good a mood i'm in i cant stop smiling. I guess being warm and comfy is a big deal for me, that or I like buying stuff and money makes me feel better...man why must the one way i can instantly perk myself up be something i dont get to do often ;&gt;&gt; Or maybe i just needed to get out of the damn house for a couple hours.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T11:16:35-08:00","id":308384,"title":"","content":"I'm still alive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T12:54:13-08:00","id":308469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=308384#post308384\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm still alive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.smiffbib.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/holygrainotdead.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https: