name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T08:57:40-07:00","id":554359,"title":"","content":"Day 2 without medication: So far so good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T19:50:22-07:00","id":560246,"title":"","content":"So, I've been bummed for almost a week. To the pint of tears at some pints. Cant stop focusing on certain isues I have, including how I never get out anymore and have no friends, and one other related issue I'd rather not mention. Even taking a day trip to a resort or going today to my towns annual fair havnt improved my mood. I dont sleep well anymore, cant enjoy stuff I try tk get my mind off it, like a few games, books, or even putting on my favorite movie. And talking to my one friend, hearing about her perfect life, makes me feel even worse, even though shes not doing anything wrong it hurts talking to her (I usually enjoy talking to her). And you all may have seen my bender over the weekend.<br /> <br /> So, is it time I seek help? Or is this just me being a loser and theres nothing they can do about it?<br /> <br /> Not sure if I could afford a thereapist though. And it sounds silly to seek one out just because I feel sad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T20:09:02-07:00","id":560266,"title":"","content":"Profound, lasting sadness is exactly the type of reason you should seek out therapy. <br /> <br /> I'm sorry, Hunter. I've been where you are, and it sucks. I would recommend getting out and seeing people. And exercising. Exercise is greatly helpful. Meditation can be quite helpful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T20:35:58-07:00","id":560284,"title":"","content":"Dont know where all to get out too. Over the last decade I've been leaving my apartment less and less. And was never that social before too. And dven if I did, I effectivly have a lost decade I'll never get back....<br /> <br /> Tried thinking bck how I got here. Not sure, but also realized I dont tink I've ever had real friends. So dont know where to go or how to meet people....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","u