ter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-18T02:32:11-07:00","id":630881,"title":"","content":"That's good to know at least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-18T17:49:49-07:00","id":631775,"title":"","content":"Ok, after what just happened Im ready to give up. Just no plan yet....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-18T21:19:35-07:00","id":631889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=631775#post631775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, after what just happened Im ready to give up. Just no plan yet....</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Woah woah woah, let's back this thought process up a little, bud:<br /> <br /> What??<br /> <br /> Not trying to pry, but...what happened? If you're really contemplating self-injury, and I never take a warning sign as just a cry for help, then I please ask that you talk about what's bothering you. Please don't disconnect socially, as it usually only exacerbates the more self-destructive parts in the thoughts of a person who's already suffering.<br /> Try to reach out. If you can't talk elsewhere, talk here. You, personally, matter to people. More importantly, the pain you're feeling, stress you're going through...that will pass. I promise. Even if you bear a scar afterwards inside, it'll pass and you'll find a smile. I always do, and I'm pretty sure I'm existentially fucked.<br /> <br /> to repeat, let's talk. You have friendly souls here. Please, please don't hurt yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-19-2015, 12:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-18T22:19:44-07:00","id":631912,"title":"","content":"I'm seconding what az said. Please vent here, reach out to anyone cause many of us will gladly be a kind ear. None of us wish anything bad for you, and i'm damn sure none of us will judge you in any way shape or form. i seriously am offering you the biggest ehug i can muster, same to you cerealkiller, I want either of you to PM me, or track me down on skype: <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#2d5e4e4841485e594c6d41445b48034e4240\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"80f3e3e5ece5f3f4e1c0ece9f6e5aee3efed\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>, or for those more text inclined: 971-217-1382, if you ever just wanna chat, doesnt have to be anything serious! We can seriously just find something interesting to chat about! (Side note, anyone is welcome to message me if they want!) I have no life outside my home so i'm almost always able to reply pretty quick! <br /> <br /> Just dont make any plans, take each day one day at time, find something anything that makes you smile, makes you happy. Be it a good book, music, a stupid picture you find online that makes you chuckle if only for a moment. Depressioin fucking sucks, and I'm not telling you to &quot;get over it' or that the above will magically make it go away forever, but it can help but for a moment and sometimes a moment is really what a person who is badly depressed needs. A moment to find something to smile at. For yourself, make a SMALL goal, something you are sure you can do each day and do it! It will be hard at first, it may seem impossible but fuck what your brain keeps telling you.you are stronger then that.Our brains are our worst enemies sometimes, and you really ahve to remind yourself you deserve to live, and that it IS possible to keep fighting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T03:53:52-07:00","id":632128,"title":"","content":"Sound advice, you two. Listen to them, they really know what they are talking about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T13:41:47-07:00","id":632699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=630152#post630152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would like to echo this statement please.</div> </div> </div> </div>Same here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T14:40:51-07:00","id":632725,"title":"","content":"I just re-joined this board, and I was a member for some time at the old White Wolf Forums... anyhow, I was reading through these posts. Really just kind of taking in what people were saying and the myriad of issues that all of you are dealing with. I just felt like jumping in and responding in a general sense, because I don't think that I actually know any of you... perhaps we chatted at some point in times past? Anyhow...<br /> <br /> 1) Suicide: Those of you who are thinking about ending it all, Think about the people that do actually love and care for you. To some, there may not be anyone and to you I then ask, have yu actually looked or paid attention? Or have you been so overcome by your issues that you failed to recognize a hand when it was offered? Suicide... do not take your life! Call on someone, anyone, somebody and just talk. Talk about anything and everything. Talk about the nothingness, but just talk and do not give up. I can tell you, life is a bitch. But life is also the most singularly wondrous thing that you will ever experience. If you end it now, you will never know what comes next if you don't. So, don't. For now, wait. Every day brings new opportunity.<br /> <br /> 2) Transgenders: Not my topic and I have oft been criticized because of my views on Transgender, homosexual, etc. The only point I want to make in this is that YOU are who YOU are. Do not let others (Myself included) stand against you. Be WHO you are because THAT is the REAL YOU! When you find who you are, you will be a bit happier. Look at Bruce Jenner (Or don't, I turn the tube off every time I hear his/her name(s). Anyhow, just be you and you will discover more about yourself that you ever thought possible.<br /> <br /> 3) Depression: Peeps, we all go through it. Some of us are clinically diagnosed with it (I am not but fight it every single day). Depression is what it is, a phase. Sometimes it takes a really long ass time to kick it.. sometimes its a mood swing, but it is just as real as you are sitting there reading this. If you have clinical depression, again I refer you to my notes under Suicide. Talk to someone, anyone, anybody. But just talk. It does in fact help, even if you don't realize it at the moment.<br /> <br /> 4) People, one of the most important things that everyone needs to remember is that you are loved for WHO and for WHAT you are. Sometimes, you can't see it. Sometimes you can. A Hug can help tremendously but it can also bring about strange unfamiliar feelings within you. Just take it at face value and try not to overthink it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 08-27-2015, 01:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1707-baldurkhan","name":"Baldurkhan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T00:59:39-07:00","id":633258,"title":"","content":"I don't know if anyone here will find anything useful in <a href=\"http://namebrandlindsay.com/2014/08/12/why-some-peoples-minds-try-to-kill-them/\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> or <a href=\"http://hyperboleandahalf.blogspot.com.au/2013/05/depression-part-two.html\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>, but I found it pretty helpful in understanding the depressed mind<br /> <br /> EDIT: I, of course, use the term 'understand' extremely loosely. It's not an area I've studied, and my experiences are limited mostly to the periods of 'the world sucks' that everyone deals with","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","user":"Allan53","date":". 08-20-2015, 04:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T02:03:39-07:00","id":633304,"title":"","content":"Hope all are well. Insomnia. Anxiety. I'll ramble at length in the thread I made for that exact reason. *wanders off into the alley*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"ht