 transgender community...did you read the other part of that paragraph @Charlaquin?<br /> Guy noted he had a controversial and possibly offensive personal opinion, then went on to say his opinion basically had no bearing on this subject save that he wants people to be themselves and happy.<br /> <br /> Sorry if anyone was offended by me. Just kidding. Grow up.<br /> <br /> Fucking Kardashians... *grumble grumble*<br /> <br /> - Az,<br /> Bisexual Comedian and Actual Fucking Patron of This Company's Products<br /> <br /> (Now nobody say anything. I might read your responses and cry.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Willfully misgendering a person is pretty much akin to saying that you don't think trans people's genders are &quot;real&quot;. Which is not only an attack on the person you're attacking, but also on every trans person.<br /> <br /> As for the fact that Baldurkhan said he has nothing against trans people... Saying so in the very same sentence where he knowingly misgenders one is very much like saying &quot;I've got nothing against gays/blacks/etc, but they really shouldn't ask for the right to marry each others / ask to marry white people.&quot; and then expecting other to consider that the obvious insult is negated by the fact that he supposedly has nothing against them. It's a pretty thin disguise for biggotry is what I'm saying.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T09:42:05-07:00","id":633526,"title":"","content":"I wrote a thing, but I erased it to let people continue being offended.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://youtu.be/o70G2DTsyVM\" data-code=\"o70G2DTsyVM\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/o70G2DTsyVM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-20-2015, 12:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T10:48:00-07:00","id":633579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=633506#post633506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> When did She start posting on the OPP forums? I was unaware that Caitlyn was a White Wolfer.<br /> <br /> She's not, you say? Just a random television celebrity that used to be an athlete, you say? Huh.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, I don't know if she is or not. I wouldn't assume she is, but I really have no way of knowing. More importantly, Rule 1 is &quot;respect other people&quot;, not &quot;respect other users of this forum.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=633506#post633506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, ...then who gives a shit??? I'm a strong supporter of LGBT rights, but...<br /> <br /> I was unaware we had to be mindful of the feelings of all living humans with every post, lest we hypothetically offend reality tv stars and famous celebrities hiding here in anonymity. Glad I found out. I was about to say something rude about Betty White.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not a matter of offending or not offending people. The rule is not &quot;don't offend anyone&quot;, it's &quot;be respectful.&quot; Misgendering someone is not a respectful thing to do, and as LeTepix pointed out, it's disrespectful to all trans people by implying their name and pronoun preferences are invalid.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=633506#post633506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">AS for offending the transgender community...did you read the other part of that paragraph @Charlaquin?<br /> Guy noted he had a controversial and possibly offensive personal opinion, then went on to say his opinion basically had no bearing on this subject save that he wants people to be themselves and happy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which would have been fine if he had not then gone on to insult a trans person and the trans community in general. Prefacing your disrespectful post with &quot;I have controversial opinions, but you do you&quot; doesn't change the fact that the statement that follows it is still disrespectful.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=633506#post633506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry if anyone was offended by me. Just kidding. Grow up.<br /> <br /> <br /> Fucking Kardashians... *grumble grumble*<br /> <br /> - Az,<br /> Bisexual Comedian and Actual Fucking Patron of This Company's Products<br /> <br /> (Now nobody say anything. I might read your responses and cry.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, it's really not a question of if anyone is offended or not. You are expected to respect others and respect the conversation if you want to post on these forums.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T11:30:51-07:00","id":633615,"title":"","content":"I don't know Caitlyn Jenner nor do I have strong feelings about her. But when you misgender a trans person, it feels like you are misgendering all of us. It may not be your intent, you might have trans friends you would never misgender, but what we hear when you call Caitlyn by the wrong name or gender is that trans persons are not the gender they say they are. If one thinks Caitlyn isn't, can I reasonably believe they they would not say I am not either? What goal do I meet that she doesn't. If you think Caitlyn Jenner is an attention hog you can say that. That does not affect me or any other trans poster. But when she is misgendered or called by the wrong name, that is an attack on all of us, because the trait you are attacking is a trait we also hold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T11:42:38-07:00","id":633632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baron Samedi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=633615#post633615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I don't know Caitlyn Jenner nor do I have strong feelings about her. But when you misgender a trans person, it feels like you are misgendering all of us. It may not be your intent, you might have trans friends you would never misgender, but what we hear when you call Caitlyn by the wrong name or gender is that trans persons are not the gender they say they are. If one thinks Caitlyn isn't, can I reasonably believe they they would not say I am not either? What goal do I meet that she doesn't. If you think Caitlyn Jenner is an attention hog you can say that. That does not affect me or any other trans poster. But when she is misgendered or called by the wrong name, that is an attack on all of us, because the trait you are attacking is a trait we also hold.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Perhaps, but on the other hand, is a person NOT entitled to their opionin regardless of how contriversal it is? I'm a huge supporter of trans people, but even i slip up and use the wrong pronoun every now and then. Now granted i dont mean it to be an attack, and I think what was said was simply a statement of opinion, I dont understand why a person cant simply state their thoughts without being attacked. Is that not also a violation? So what they said doesnt agree with what another MAY consider okay, is it really fair to single someone out? I call myself a woman, catlyn calls herself a women. My fiance calls catlyn a man,i call her a women, do i get my panties in a bunch and question my gender over it? NOPE. Not everyone is going to call a trans person by their gender, its sad, and it sucks, but you shouldnt let anothers opionion determin how YOU think of yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":897,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","user":"Scelesta","date":". 08-20-2015, 02:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T11:54:04-07:00","id":633637,"title":"","content":"People can hold any hateful opinion they want as long as they do not post it here. One can hate whites, blacks, jews, athiests, trans persons, gays, whatever, but when they post opinions on this forum attacking those groups, we act on it. It's an attack. Misgendering trans persons is an attack on trans persons. There are trans persons here. So we act on it.<br /> <br /> I'd love to live in a world where people are not judged by the color of their skin, their gender, who they love, or anything like that, but for their character alone. We are not there yet. But on the forum, we can at least try to stop this kind of thing. And it's not a witch hunt; either one posts that sort of thing or they don't. If someone is transphobic, for example, but never misgenders people or makes similar comments and posts helpful and insightful stuff, we won't go digging to see if they are a transphobe. We just act when the line is crossed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T13:32:40-07:00","id":633750,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scelesta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=633632#post633632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not everyone is going to call a trans person by their gender, it's sad, and it sucks, but you shouldn't let another's opinion determine how you think of yourself.</div> </div> </div> </div>A while ago, the moderators took action against me for calling some homophobes assholes. The circumstances don't matter because the mods were right: It <i>was</i> a group attack. My shame at being, well, shamed like that (I will remind you at this point it was an entirely deserved shaming) was so much that I had an episode, went to the bathroom, and slit some new scars into myself as punishment for being weak and stupid and wrong.<br /> <br /> I mention this story in relationship to your quote because even as I was doing it, I knew I shouldn't let another's opinion of me determine how I feel about myself,* but knowing that doesn't change anything about how I feel. If it does for you, then seriously, good for you. I'm glad and more than a little envious you don't have to go through the kinds of crisis of ego or self-esteem that some of the rest of us do. Just let me suggest--gently, I hope, and with no judgment intended--that telling people we shouldn't feel the way we feel is probably not terrifically effective on its own.<br /> <br /> <br /> *Not that the moderators probably thought of me as weak and stupid, but as I said, I was having an episode.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0