can't get you one of those nice parking spaces? I want my Psychotic Handicapped Sign, dammit!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T16:40:59-07:00","id":635130,"title":"","content":"Unban Az. That's all","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T16:53:11-07:00","id":635143,"title":"","content":"So what so!some fucked up on a gender pronoun. I'm willing to come back from the dead for this bullshit. Unless the person is being malicious its never intentional and if you view it as malicious at accident then grow some fucking skin. This is why I was leaving anyways, pseudointellectual bullshit. You mod voice over something YOU decide to take personally. Go fuck yourself if anyone wants to chat with me I'm on skype,. Az would give you the info bit some buffoon clown of a tyrant banned him. I'm probably gone too but whatever.gotta call out bullshit sometimes.<br /> 