orum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","user":"cerealkiller","date":". 08-21-2015, 10:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T22:24:05-07:00","id":635446,"title":"","content":"For the record, all I did was pointed out that the misgendering was disrespectful and reminded baldurkhan of the rules. I did not issue an infraction because it seemed like an honest mistake. I took no action against Az, because that would have been a conflict of interest. Rose issued a temporary suspension for the rant. Just because a user has a &quot;banned&quot; title under their username does not mean they have been permanently banned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 08-22-2015, 01:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T22:24:59-07:00","id":635448,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">You want dialogue? Absolutely! <br /> <br /> Allow me to paraphrase Rose's explanation for the tight policing of this thread: &quot;Nobody has to be polite about celebrities for their own sake. But as referring to celebrities may affect other posters or derail a thread, moderators are fully within their remit to nudge