link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T06:27:29-07:00","id":635714,"title":"","content":"Says a lot about me which when I read the original mod post on the subject, it immediately set my mind to running about contexts (however infrequent they may exist) where it may be appropriate to refer to Bruce/Caitlyn Jenner, and use the phrase &quot;his/her names&quot;. Not out of disrespect, she has made her wishes very clear and it's easy enough to go along with her wishes on this, just because it seemed like an entertaining &quot;problem&quot; to try to &quot;solve&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Back on original topic (such as it is):<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=634223#post634223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Minor rant, one we all know well: Doesn't it suck having a handicap that has no outward signs and that can't get you one of those nice parking spaces? I want my Psychotic Handicapped Sign, dammit!</div> </div> </div> </div>This immediately made me think about what it would look like. I mean, you could (and in good taste, probably should) use the standard wheelchair symbol, but am I the only one who would chuckle if it looked like a guy lying on a couch, Freud-style? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T12:23:02-07:00","id":639361,"title":"","content":"[MESSAGE REDACTED]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1958,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","user":"Krobeles","date":".  Deleted the post, as it was apparently breaking the rules. 08-25-2015, 04:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T12:30:17-07:00","id":639372,"title":"","content":"Reminder, discussing a ban is a ban grade offense., be it in the forum or a site based PM. All part of the rules you read and agreed to.<br /> <br /> If you think a mod overstepped bounds we're supposed to email the admin (Rose) about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internall