m":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T20:53:43-07:00","id":689157,"title":"","content":"*hugs* <br /> <br /> Turning my phone back on now. I'll try calling tomorrow during the day. I'm sorry that I'm worrying you. I don't know why I'm pulling away from people. Thank you for being there to pull me back, Scel. I <b>need</b> friends that care enough to try. I appreciate it more than you'll ever know<br /> Thorbes, buddy, same goes for you. Thank you.<br /> <br /> Cereal, my ninja, I'm sorry I haven't been making sense. I'll try to explain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T22:52:01-07:00","id":689347,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/32483-the-mental-health-thread?p=689157#post689157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*hugs*<br /> <br /> Turning my phone back on now. I'll try calling tomorrow during the day. I'm sorry that I'm worrying you. I don't know why I'm pulling away from people. Thank you for being there to pull me back, Scel. I <b>need</b> friends that care enough to try. I appreciate it more than you'll ever know<br /> Thorbes, buddy, same goes for you. Thank you.<br /> <br /> Cereal, my ninja, I'm sorry I haven't been making sense. I'll try to explain.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Good! I missed talking to you even if only texts nice to have someone else awake at the ungodly hours i've been awake lately <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Dont be sorry, I worry cause i care, If i didnt i wouldnt have been contemplating various ways to get ahold of you, some of which involved internet searches to get your adress so i could send a letter or something. (Yano just to show I know how to find you and hiding is pointless XD ) Dear god i sound creepy but seriously I care to much not to go into stalker mode. Dunno how reassuring that is... <br /> Depression is a royal bitch would be my guess as to why you're pulling away. <br /> No thanks are needed, I'm not about to let go of my best friend without a fight I'd miss you way to much. *hugs*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","