right now, and why i'm needing to be left the fuck alone unless i reach out first.<br /> <br /> I'm being stubborn/stupid. Refusing to even try to go to therapy..trying to figure out how to get back on my meds...I'm BARELY able to say &quot;I need help&quot; but i do. I'm slipping, i'm starting to have trouble taking care of my daughter because of this crap, i'm trying but its hard doing this without much help, and my fiance wont allow me to hire a nanny ONE day a week from 6am-1pm so i can get some rest cause if i can get that mid week i'm fine...But nope, i'm supposed to just man up and adult without any help cause clearly if i need help i'm not a good mother. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I'm just going to shut up now cause i'm going on and on.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878\">Prometheus878</a>- /hugs! Hope things are improving for you!</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T17:10:31-07:00","id":711459,"title":"","content":"Well my primary doctor was unwilling to prescribe anything for my anxiety and depression.(cause I tried to kill myself on the last thing he prescribed he no longer feels comfortable 