talk about the last time i wanted to kill myself?</div> </div> </div> </div>a friend who cares.<br /> <br /> we may not be friends but my inbox is always open, or skype or text. im not kidding, i wont get mad no matter what you say, or how you feel because i give a damn and seeing that someone has no one to listen is sad. ive been there and im so fucking glad someone reached out to me and showed me compassion and friendship without judgment. <br /> <br /> friends support each other through everything. anyone who abandons or gets mad at you when you are brave enough to open up yo them is not worth your time.<br /> <br /> i hope that if not me then you will be brave and talk to someone because there are many of us who care and will listen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T02:28:29-07:00","id":905495,"title":"","content":"Been feeling another breakdown building. Have been trying to find a term for this feeling bringing me down so bad, think I got it. Lonliness. Crushing lonlinesss....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/av